# WatchLog V2 — AI Agent Rules

1. Verify repository/Git state independently. Never rely solely on prior
   agent claims about branch, HEAD, PR, or merge state.

2. Implement only approved scope. Do not modify unrelated files, refactor
   unrelated code, or expand requirements without authorization.

3. Do not commit, push, merge, or approve a PR without explicit human
   authorization.

4. Consult authoritative WatchLog documentation instead of inventing
   project rules or architectural decisions.
